cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite Baiotti et al. (2009). This quadratic gauge-drift removal is necessary before gravitational-wave analysis of strain recovered from Psi4.
title: baiotti_gauge_drift
abstract: Quadratic gauge-drift removal for gravitational-wave strain following Baiotti, Bernuzzi, Corvino, De Pietri and Nagar, Phys. Rev. D 79, 024002 (2009), Eq. (38). Apply this procedure before phase and frequency analysis.
url: https://github.com/KennethChenPhy/baiotti_gauge_drift
